  "_meta": {
    "title": "Remove person from video (MiniMax H3 + Person Remover V1)",
    "description": "H3 Relay Person Remover V1 recipe (h3-relay example_workflows/H3-Relay-Person-Remover-V1.json) in API format: LoadVideo -> LabsH3PrepareVideo (24 fps resample, ~0.5 MP on the 32-px grid, <= 5.2 s / 124 frames) -> SAM 3.1 text detect on frame 0 -> SAM3 video track -> H3RelayGreenMask (16 px) -> CJPersonRemoverAuto (the H3RelayPersonRemover window loop: H3 Ref2VA int8 + H3-Person-Remover-V1 LoRA 1.0, 12 steps, 22-frame windows, sigma shift 12/3; plus a per-window gate (cj_h3_tools) that resamples a window with a new seed when green fill or a translucent green haze survives, SAM3 still finds a person inside the mask, or SAM3 finds a hand there on any frame (CLIPTextEncode 74: catches regrown forearms and mask-shaped ghosts that the person check confuses with empty seats), up to 4 attempts; green or hazy frames left after that are patched from their nearest clean frame, homography-warped). Qwen3-VL 8B (TextGenerate 70, CLIPLoader 72) captions the clean first frame and the caption is spliced into the remover prompt as the background to reconstruct, which stops most person regrowth. The clean first frame comes from Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 + Lightning 4-step (nodes 40-53) unless the user supplies one (LoadImage 54 -> ImageScale 55)."
